-// Shared tvm-ffi launcher for the generated Cake SM90 (Hopper) variable
-// block-sparse attention stages.  flashinfer/jit/cake_vsa_sm90.py compiles this
-// translation unit once per stage next to that stage's device source; the stage
-// is selected through the defines below, so the 14 launchers share one host
-// source.
-//
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_KERNEL          kernel symbol of the device source (identifier)
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_SHIM_NAMESPACE  per-module host-shim namespace (identifier)
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_THREADS         thread-block size
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_SMEM_BYTES      dynamic shared memory
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_CLUSTER_X       thread-block cluster size (1 = plain launch)
-//   CAKE_VSA_SM90_ABI             1 = small-selection plan ABI, 2 = split-KV plan
-//                                 ABI (+ Wo/Ws/Wc partials), 3 = persistent ABI
-//                                 (meta/hdr/tile_stride/dbg/tl)
