-    grids that spread ``n_tiles`` uniformly (``ceil(n / k)`` CTAs for k tiles
-    each) while keeping at least ``GRID_MIN_FRACTION`` of the SMs busy.
-    Mirrors ``vsa_sm90_bf16._grid_candidates``."""
